    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900402/2009004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……ファミレスはメニューが多いから悩むよなあ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004020070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　あたし、いっつも悩んじゃいます",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900402/2009004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004020080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "どれもスゴく美味しそうに見えます……\r\nおなかが空いてるからでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900402/2009004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ。そうかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゆっくりメニュー見て\r\n果穂が１番食べたいものを選べばいいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004020090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。じゃあ……えっとえっと、\r\nこれ、かなぁ……あ、でも、これもこれもいいなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900402/2009004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009004020100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんっ。この３つの中なら\r\nどれが１番いいと思いますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900402/2009004020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "l",
